# The station with the A72 pair available (2026-11-01-mt6797-all-cores). The
# capabilities must be set at boot and the DVFSP handoff owns I2C6, so both are
# built in. The bring-up is a module: loading it brings CPU8 and CPU9 online, and
# nothing loads it. Boot this with mt6797-gemini-pda-station-a72.dtb.
CONFIG_ARM64_MT6797_LATE_A72=y
CONFIG_MTK_MT6797_DVFSP_HANDOFF=y
CONFIG_MTK_MT6797_A72=m
